{"abstract":[{"text":"The element and position attributes are new as of Version 2.0. They allow for bookmarks and links to be","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"positioned at higher resolution than the level of music-data elements. When no element and position attributes","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"are present, the bookmark or link element refers to the next sibling element in the MusicXML file. The element","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"attribute specifies an element type for a descendant of the next sibling element that is not a link or","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"bookmark. The position attribute specifies the position of this descendant element, where the first position"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"is 1. The position attribute is ignored if the element attribute is not present. For instance, an element"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"value of “beam” and a position value of “2” defines the link or bookmark to refer to the second beam","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"descendant of the next sibling element that is not a link or bookmark. This is equivalent to an XPath test of","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"[.\/\/beam[2]] done in the context of the sibling element.","type":"text"}],"metadata":{"modules":[{"name":"IvorMXL"}],"externalID":"s:7IvorMXL18MXLElementPositionV","roleHeading":"Structure","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"MXLElementPosition","kind":"identifier"}],"title":"MXLElementPosition","role":"symbol","symbolKind":"struct","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"MXLElementPosition","kind":"identifier"}]},"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"major":0,"patch":0},"topicSections":[{"anchor":"Initializers","generated":true,"title":"Initializers","identifiers":["doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLElementPosition\/init(element:position:)"]},{"anchor":"Instanc